(7751670, 1280904, 9668, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Zoomdak:</b></div><hr/><i> Lovely color in the sky, and such a rad landmark. I feel like the composition would have been stronger by showing just the tree and not the shoreline on the left. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I originally had a close crop of the tree in for this challenge, but felt this one was better. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Good choice on that, specially getting a red ribbon for it, well done!</td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: Originally posted by Zoomdak: Lovely color in the sky, and such a rad landmark. I feel like the composition would have been stronger by showing just the tree and not the shoreline on the left.   I originally had a close crop of the tree in for this challenge, but felt this one was better.  Good choice on that, specially getting a red ribbon for it, well done!', '2023-06-23 15:20:33.000000', NULL, 0),
